{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"verdict\": \"both_partly\",\n  \"quotes\": [\n    \"We exploited this platform in 18 patients with Parkinson’s disease, which allowed us to demonstrate that the subthalamic nucleus encodes the initiation, termination, and vigor of leg muscle activation.\",\n    \"We conceived a neurorobotic platform that allowed us to deconstruct the key components of walking under well-controlled conditions.\",\n    \"Four participants exhibited frequent episodes of freezing of gait, predominantly whilst turning.\",\n    \"We asked a neurologist expert in movement disorders (A.Z.) to define these periods based on video recordings.\",\n    \"To capture the precise time windows during which both feet were “glued to the floor” 28, we combined these visually-defined periods with analyses of accelerometer data from sensors attached to the shoes of the participants.\",\n    \"Visual inspection of LFP spectral features revealed that these periods correlated with the emergence of predominant low-beta signatures in bilateral STN LFP.\",\n    \"Clinical evaluation: Periods of freezing of gait were identified based on video analysis by a neurologist expert in movement disorders (A.Z).\",\n    \"Four patients exhibited episodes of freezing, which differed in their types 28 and severity (duration and frequency of events).\",\n    \"Overall, 17 patients were retained for analyses on the neurorobotic platform and 12 for gait experiments.\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"双方各有部分正确。首先，指控者关于研究整体性质的判断成立。论文不是一项仅有4名患者参与的转弯冻结研究，而是一项研究帕金森病患者STN如何编码腿部肌肉激活及步行活动的综合研究。摘要明确报告18名患者参与，研究使用神经机器人平台，在受控条件下研究腿部肌肉激活的启动、终止和运动活力，并进一步研究实际步行及机器学习解码。方法部分还显示，研究招募20名患者，最终17名用于神经机器人平台分析、12名用于步态实验。其次，报告关于4名患者实际发生FOG的证据则有原文支持。论文结果部分明确指出，4名参与者出现频繁的步态冻结发作，而且主要发生在转弯过程中。研究者根据运动障碍专家对视频的分析确定冻结时段，并使用鞋部加速度传感器识别双脚实际粘在地面、没有运动的时间段。因此，这4人并非仅仅被算法预测可能发生冻结，而是研究中确实观察并识别了实际FOG事件。结论：如果Y将整篇论文概括为一项仅针对4名患者的转弯FOG研究，则属于对研究整体设计和样本规模的误读；但如果Y引用该论文证明有4名患者实际出现FOG，尤其是主要发生于转弯时，则有全文明确依据。指控者正确指出了研究整体性质被误述，但错误地否定了论文对4人实际发生冻结的证据支持，因此判定为both_partly。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "1b90265e-4e00-42fc-9329-13285aac450a", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261113T104628566646Z", "elapsed_seconds": 27.828, "completed_utc": "2026-11-13T10:46:56.403905+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "b42d070e78f2f2ab6db86ca5f470f1bf6fcaff417b1d09ad8c695e57b1693a41", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261113T104628566646Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "47791b10aa8a27b21117561244a0793f61d746937fa7cbb980d777378ea38c48"}}}
